// SKY PARITY (SA-SKY): the Brickmap's sun-highlight and haze terms as one
// package (that is how the Brickmap ships them). _SvoSkyMode 0 keeps the
// legacy sky bit-identical (used by the control arm + pre-decision captures);
// normal runs default ON via the render feature (probe runs forward the
// per-arm mode). Owner decision 2026-09-20: ON with RESTRAINED haze (1.2).
